@host = http://localhost:5080
@clientId = 1

### Insert. Omit Id; the response contains the generated task ID.
POST {{host}}/api/tasks?clientId={{clientId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "First task",
  "description": "Stored in tasks",
  "userId": "",
  "projectId": 0,
  "moduleId": 0,
  "statusId": 1107001,
  "priorityId": 1108003,
  "sp": 1.25,
  "startDate": "2026-09-17T10:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-09-17T11:00:00",
  "reason": "",
  "isActive": true
}

### List tasks through TMS_Search_Tasks.
GET {{host}}/api/tasks?clientId={{clientId}}

### Replace 1 with the ID returned by POST.
GET {{host}}/api/tasks/1?clientId={{clientId}}
